{"unit_id":"tag:04DV:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。假设对任意<MATH_0002>，当它平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）时，有\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0003>具有性质(C)，且\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0004>为闭（closed）的。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n则函子（functor）<MATH_0005>、<MATH_0006>几乎余连续（almost cocontinuous），参见《景（Sites）》定义<REF_0001>。\n","allowed_english":["C"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"closed","target_term":"闭"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"almost cocontinuous","target_term":"几乎余连续"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"closed","target_term":"闭","context":"子集闭性。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"almost cocontinuous","target_term":"几乎余连续","context":"景之间函子的性质。"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景","context":"引用章节。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04DX:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。假设<MATH_0002>普遍（universally）单射（injective）且整（integral）（例如闭浸入（closed immersion））。则\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0003>反映（reflects）单射（injections）与满射（surjections），\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0004>与推出（pushouts）及余等化子（coequalizers）交换（commutes）（更一般地，与有限（finite）连通（connected）余极限（colimits）交换），\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0005>将满射（surjections）变为满射（surjections）（对集合（sets）层（sheaves）和阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）），\n<STRUCT_0005> 映射（map）<MATH_0006>为满射（surjective），对任意层（sheaf）（集合（sets）或阿贝尔群（abelian groups）的层）<MATH_0007>，定义于<MATH_0008>上，成立，\n<STRUCT_0006> 函子（functor）<MATH_0009>忠实（faithful）（对集合（sets）层（sheaves）和阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）），\n<STRUCT_0007> <MATH_0010>正合（exact），且\n<STRUCT_0008> 函子（functor）<MATH_0011>、<MATH_0012>几乎余连续（almost cocontinuous）。\n<STRUCT_0009>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"universally","target_term":"普遍"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"integral","target_term":"整"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"},{"source_term":"reflects","target_term":"反映"},{"source_term":"injections","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"surjections","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"pushouts","target_term":"推出"},{"source_term":"coequalizers","target_term":"余等化子"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"connected","target_term":"连通"},{"source_term":"colimits","target_term":"余极限"},{"source_term":"surjections","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"surjections","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"faithful","target_term":"忠实"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"almost cocontinuous","target_term":"几乎余连续"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"universally","target_term":"普遍","context":"任意基变换后均单射。"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射","context":"态射单射性。"},{"source_term":"integral","target_term":"整","context":"整态射。"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"reflects","target_term":"反映","context":"函子反映单射与满射。"},{"source_term":"injections","target_term":"单射","context":"层映射单射性。"},{"source_term":"surjections","target_term":"满射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"pushouts","target_term":"推出","context":"范畴的推出。"},{"source_term":"coequalizers","target_term":"余等化子","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换","context":"函子与指定余极限交换。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"connected","target_term":"连通","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"colimits","target_term":"余极限","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"faithful","target_term":"忠实","context":"函子忠实性。"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合","context":"函子正合性。"},{"source_term":"almost cocontinuous","target_term":"几乎余连续","context":"景之间函子的性质。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04DX:proof","translation":"由引理<REF_0001>、<REF_0002>和<REF_0003>，可知态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>具有性质(A)、(B)及(C)。此外，由引理<REF_0004>，可知函子（functor）<MATH_0002>几乎余连续（almost cocontinuous）。现在有\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 性质(C)由引理<REF_0005>蕴涵(1)，\n<STRUCT_0003> 几乎连续（almost continuous）由《景（Sites）》引理<REF_0006>蕴涵(2)，\n<STRUCT_0004> 性质(B)由引理<REF_0007>蕴涵(3)。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n性质(4)、(5)、(6)由前三项形式地推出，参见《景（Sites）》引理<REF_0008>及《景上的模（Modules on Sites）》引理<REF_0009>。性质(7)已在上面看到。\n","allowed_english":["A","B","C"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"almost cocontinuous","target_term":"几乎余连续"},{"source_term":"almost continuous","target_term":"几乎连续"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"景上的模"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"almost cocontinuous","target_term":"几乎余连续","context":"景之间函子的性质。"},{"source_term":"almost continuous","target_term":"几乎连续","context":"按此处英文原词保留。"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景","context":"引用章节。"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"景上的模","context":"引用章节。"}],"notes":["原文第(2)项使用almost continuous，而前文使用almost cocontinuous；候选分别忠实翻译，未修正英文表述。"]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04DY:title","translation":"小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）景（site）的拓扑不变性（Topological invariance）","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"Topological invariance","target_term":"拓扑不变性"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小","context":"景的大小。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"Topological invariance","target_term":"拓扑不变性","context":"标题主题。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04DY:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n以下定理中，我们证明小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）景（site）在如下意义下是拓扑不变量（topological invariant）：若<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism），且为普遍同胚（universal homeomorphism），则<MATH_0002>，作为景（sites）。这改进了《平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）态射（Morphisms）》定理<REF_0001>的结果。我们先对态射（morphisms）证明此结果，再对范畴（categories）陈述此结果。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"topological invariant","target_term":"拓扑不变量"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"universal homeomorphism","target_term":"普遍同胚"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"Étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小","context":"景的大小。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"topological invariant","target_term":"拓扑不变量","context":"景的拓扑不变性。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"universal homeomorphism","target_term":"普遍同胚","context":"任意基变换后为同胚。"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"Étale","target_term":"平展","context":"引用章节。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"引用章节。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"暂定译法。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0BTY:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>为两个概形（schemes），定义于基概形（base scheme）<MATH_0003>上。设<MATH_0004>为普遍同胚（universal homeomorphism）。记<MATH_0005>（分别地，<SPACE_0001><MATH_0006>）为到<MATH_0007>的基变换（base change）。若<MATH_0008>平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale），定义于<MATH_0009>上，则映射（map）<MATH_0010>为双射（bijective）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"base scheme","target_term":"基概形"},{"source_term":"universal homeomorphism","target_term":"普遍同胚"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"bijective","target_term":"双射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"base scheme","target_term":"基概形","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"universal homeomorphism","target_term":"普遍同胚","context":"任意基变换后为同胚。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"bijective","target_term":"双射","context":"暂定译法。"}],"notes":[]}
